<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP year Queensland coal output rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP year Queensland coal output rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Tuesday it produced 23.78 million tonnes of coal from its Queensland mines in the year to end-May, up nine percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>Iron ore output over the 12 months to May 31 was six percent higher over the previous 12 months mainly as a result of higher demand for iron ore from the company's Yandi mine in Western Australia, BHP said.</p>
</text>
